<title>UK: INSIGHT-Cocoa delicately poised, could move lower.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Cocoa delicately poised, could move lower.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> JULY	Close  * Support * Resist * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> COCOA	995   *    980  *  1,035 *   41  *  1,019 *  1,016</p>
<p>---------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - JUNE 6----------------</p>
<p>Cocoa futures are precariously poised and look set to head lower but a firm close in the previous session may help to avert a breakdown in the short term, analysts said on Friday.</p>
</text>
